{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/extras/Demo_Information.png?t=1744227388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">When playing Skatehouse, keep in mind that it\u2019s <strong>a small-scale skate shop simulator.</strong> There are no endless queues or checkout lines\u2014just the fun of building your own little skate shop.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>YES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Build and manage your own shop</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your supply chain</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Fulfill custom orders and sell skateboards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand your store and unlock new items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BUT:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No customers walking around</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">No complicated business mechanics</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/extras/SkatehoueHeaderGifOptimized.gif?t=1744227388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/extras/SteamGIF1.gif?t=1744227388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/extras/Manage_Your_Skate_Shop.png?t=1744227388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In this is <strong>demo</strong>, you\u2019ll get to design and customize your own little skate shop and choose which products to display. Upgrade your supply chain to produce more and keep your shelves stocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/extras/SteamGIF2.gif?t=1744227388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/extras/Sell_Your_Boards.png?t=1744227388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Combine different parts and sell complete boards. You\u2019ll also unlock one new board type in this <strong>demo</strong> to meet skaters' demands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/extras/Featured_Brands_Logo.png?t=1744227388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/extras/Featured_Brands.png?t=1744227388\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DEMO INFORMATION:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo is <strong>single player</strong>, in <strong>English</strong>, and includes a limited set of skate parts\u2014about on average 2 tiers per part.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645850?t=1744227388","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3645850?t=1744227388","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/1571f262510f8a45164a28368a5515e06fdca809/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744227388","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3645850/1571f262510f8a45164a28368a5515e06fdca809/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744227388","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"i